== Overview ==
The '''Broken Heart Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] added in the [[Episode 70 Part 3 Update]]. It currently is the boss for Wave 90 of [[Endless Mode]].
== Appearance ==
It looks like a mech with has three broken hearts, one on each shoulder and one on its head. It has two miniguns, both having a 50% chance to stun. It wears a golden crown on its head.

== Waves ==

=== [[Endless Mode]] ===
Wave 90, 85,283,960 health

== Strategy ==
Always use [[Green Laser Cameraman]], for this toilet is faster than others and has a ton of health. Use high DPS units like [[Sinister Titan TV Man]]. 

== Trivia ==

* This is one of the few enemies to have a walking animation. The others are [[Frost Skeleton Toilet]], [[Giant Smooth Toilet]], [[Infected Titan Speakerman]] and the Mutant Toilet family:
** [[Mutant Toilet 2.0]]
** [[Mutant Assassin Toilet]]
** [[Buzzsaw Mutant Toilet]]
** [[Mutant Toilet]]
* Despite being a Valentine's themed enemy, this boss is present all year round, and does not have any appeances during Valentine's Day.

